<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Freegold Q1 available profit drops.</title>
<headline>Freegold Q1 available profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Available profit			  62.9 vs 110.0</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			19,195 vs 20,280</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled			3,815,000 vs 4,141,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			    5.03 vs 4.90</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  49,717 vs 47,944</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     53,655 vs 55,711</p>
<p>Full name: Free State Consolidated Gold Mines Ltd, managed by Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd</p>
